statement:
Let $s \ge 1$ and $\rho \in [0,1]$, and let $f : \{0,1\}^n \to \bbr$ be a Boolean function. Then, with expectations taken under the uniform measure on the cube, the noise operator $T_\rho$ satisfies
\[
  \bigl(\E\bigl[\abs{T_\rho f}^{s}\bigr]\bigr)^{1/s}
  \;\le\;
  \bigl(\E\bigl[\abs{f}^{s}\bigr]\bigr)^{1/s}.
\]
